        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks, for the tips on how to pinpoint the issue, That worked wonders, I figured out the cause.\r\n\r\nIt's the plugin [hardtime.nvim](https://github.com/m4xshen/hardtime.nvim). I recently added it to my config.\r\nDisabling this plugin fixes both the MiniFiles and MiniJump2D issues.\r\n\r\nStill quite weird that hardtime somehow causes issues with mini.nvim. There's a issue open for the MiniJump2D issues\r\n[#127](https://github.com/m4xshen/hardtime.nvim/issues/127)\r\n\r\nThis was my hardtime config\r\n```lua\r\nlocal function hardtime()\r\n  add({\r\n    source = \"m4xshen/hardtime.nvim\",\r\n    depends = {\r\n      \"MunifTanjim/nui.nvim\",\r\n    },\r\n  })\r\n  require(\"hardtime\").setup()\r\nend\r\n```",
